<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54169" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακληρο-νομέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> c. acc. rei, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>obtain as one's assured possession</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				4.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>leave as an inheritance</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς
				υἱοῖς τὰ ὑπάρχοντα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>De.</u>
				21.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>assign as a possession</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				13.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <i>make one's heir</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ki.</u>
				7.1
			</span></i>.</div>
